msgstr "<P>ລາຍຊື່ຮູບແບບລະບຸວ່າຈະມີຟັງຊັນໃດແດ່ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ຫຼັງຈາກຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບສຳເລັດ.</P>"

#. (see bnc#178357 why these numbers)
#. translators: help text for software proposal
#: src/modules/Packages.rb:314
msgid ""
"<P>The proposal reports the total size of files which will be installed to "
"the system. However, the system will contain some other files (temporary and "
"working files) so the used space will be slightly larger than the proposed "
"value. Therefore it is a good idea to have at least 25% (or about 300MB) "
"free space before starting the installation.</P>"
msgstr ""
"<P>ຂໍ້ສະເໜີຈະລາຍງານຂະໜາດລວມຂອງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງລົງໃນລະບົບ. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ລະບົບຈະມີໄຟລ໌ອື່ນໆນຳ "
"(ໄຟລ໌ຊົ່ວຄາວ ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ເຮັດວຽກ) ດັ່ງນັ້ນພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ໃຊ້ແທ້ຈິງຈະໃຫຍ່ກວ່າຄ່າທີ່ສະເໜີເລັກນ້ອຍ. ດ້ວຍເຫດນີ້ "
"ມັນຈຶ່ງເປັນການດີທີ່ຈະມີພື້ນທີ່ຫວ່າງຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 25% (ຫຼື ປະມານ 300MB) ກ່ອນເລີ່ມການຕິດຕັ້ງ.</P>"

#. help text for software proposal
#: src/modules/Packages.rb:323
msgid ""
"<P>The total 'size to download' is the size of the packages which will be\n"
"downloaded from remote (network) repositories. This value is important if "
"the connection is slow or if there is a data limit for downloading.</P>\n"
msgstr ""
"<P>'ຂະໜາດທັງໝົດທີ່ຈະດາວໂຫລດ' ແມ່ນຂະໜາດຂອງແພັກເກດທີ່ຈະຖືກ\n"
"ດາວໂຫລດຈາກຄັງເກັບ (ເຄືອຂ່າຍ) ທາງໄກ. ຄ່ານີ້ແມ່ນມີຄວາມສຳຄັນ ຖ້າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຊ້າ ຫຼື "
"ຖ້າມີການຈຳກັດຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບການດາວໂຫລດ.</P>\n"

#. help text for software proposal - header
#: src/modules/Packages.rb:334
msgid "<P><B>Software Proposal</B></P>"
msgstr "<P><B>ຂໍ້ສະເໜີຊອບແວ</B></P>"

#. installation proposal - SW summary, %1 is name of the installed product
#. (e.g. openSUSE 10.3, SUSE Linux Enterprise ...)
#: src/modules/Packages.rb:351
#, ycp-format
msgid "Product: %1"
msgstr "ຜະລິດຕະພັນ: %1"

#. installation proposal - SW summary, %1 is name of the selected desktop or
#. system type (e.g. KDE)
#: src/modules/Packages.rb:366
#, ycp-format
msgid "System Type: %1"
msgstr "ປະເພດລະບົບ: %1"

#. TODO: simply delete the br once we can afford to break translations again
#: src/modules/Packages.rb:378
msgid "Patterns:<br>"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບ:<br>"

#. installation proposal - SW summary, %1 is size of the selected packages (in MB or GB)
#: src/modules/Packages.rb:388
#, ycp-format
msgid "Size of Packages to Install: %1"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງແພັກເກດທີ່ຈະຕິດຕັ້ງ: %1"

#. installation proposal - SW summary, %1 is download size of the selected packages
#. which will be installed from an ftp or http repository (in MB or GB)
#: src/modules/Packages.rb:401
#, ycp-format
msgid "Downloading from Remote Repositories: %1"
msgstr "ກຳລັງດາວໂຫຼດຈາກຄັງຊອບແວທາງໄກ: %1"

#. error message: %1: e.g. "/usr", %2: "/dev/sda2"
#: src/modules/Packages.rb:454
#, ycp-format
msgid ""
"Error: Cannot check free space in basic directory %1 (device %2), cannot "
"start installation."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ: ບໍ່ສາມາດກວດສອບພື້ນທີ່ຫວ່າງໃນໂຟນເດີຫຼັກ %1 (ອຸປະກອນ %2), ບໍ່ສາມາດເລີ່ມການຕິດຕັ້ງໄດ້."

#. error message: %1: e.g. "/local", %2: "/dev/sda2"
#: src/modules/Packages.rb:475
#, ycp-format
msgid "Warning: Cannot check free space in directory %1 (device %2)."
msgstr "ຄຳເຕືອນ: ບໍ່ສາມາດກວດສອບພື້ນທີ່ຫວ່າງໃນໂຟນເດີ %1 (ອຸປະກອນ %2)."

#. summary warning
#: src/modules/Packages.rb:514
msgid "Not enough disk space."
msgstr "ພື້ນທີ່ຮາດດິດບໍ່ພຽງພໍ."

#. summary warning
#: src/modules/Packages.rb:517
msgid "Not enough disk space. Remove some packages in the single selection."
msgstr "ພື້ນທີ່ຮາດດິດບໍ່ພຽງພໍ. ກະລຸນາເອົາບາງແພັກເກດອອກໃນການເລືອກແຕ່ລະອັນ."

#. add a backslash if it's missing
#: src/modules/Packages.rb:540
#, ycp-format
msgid "Only %1 (%2%%) free space available on partition %3.<BR>"
msgstr "ມີພື້ນທີ່ຫວ່າງພຽງແຕ່ %1 (%2%%) ໃນພາທິຊັນ %3.<BR>"

#. Check the YaST required packages.
#: src/modules/Packages.rb:559
msgid "Please manually select the needed items to install."
msgstr "ກະລຸນາເລືອກລາຍການທີ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. newly installed products
#: src/modules/Packages.rb:621
#, c-format
msgid "New product <b>%s</b> will be installed"
msgstr "ຜະລິດຕະພັນໃໝ່ <b>%s</b> ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ"

#. product update: %s is a product name
#: src/modules/Packages.rb:631
#, c-format
msgid "Product <b>%s</b> will be updated"
msgstr "ຜະລິດຕະພັນ <b>%s</b> ຈະຖືກອັບເດດ"

#. product update: %{old_product} is an old product, %{new_product} is the new one
#. TRANSLATORS: Old product %{old_product} will be obsoleted by %{new_product} products.
#: src/modules/Packages.rb:635 src/modules/Packages.rb:669
#, perl-brace-format
msgid "Product <b>%{old_product}</b> will be updated to <b>%{new_product}</b>"
msgstr "ຜະລິດຕະພັນ <b>%{old_product}</b> ຈະຖືກອັບເດດເປັນ <b>%{new_product}</b>"

#: src/modules/Packages.rb:644
#, c-format
msgid "Product <b>%s</b> will stay installed"
msgstr "ຜະລິດຕະພັນ <b>%s</b> ຈະຍັງຄົງຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່"

#. Removing another product might be an issue
#. (just warn if removed by user or by YaST)
#: src/modules/Packages.rb:657
#, c-format
msgid "<b>Warning:</b> Product <b>%s</b> will be removed."
msgstr "<b>ຄຳເຕືອນ:</b> ຜະລິດຕະພັນ <b>%s</b> ຈະຖືກລຶບອອກ."

#: src/modules/Packages.rb:659
#, c-format
msgid "<b>Error:</b> Product <b>%s</b> will be automatically removed."
msgstr "<b>ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ:</b> ຜະລິດຕະພັນ <b>%s</b> ຈະຖືກລຶບອອກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. TRANSLATORS: update proposal warning, do NOT translate "-release",
#. it is part of a package name (like "sles-release")
#: src/modules/Packages.rb:702
msgid ""
"<ul><li><b>Some products are marked for automatic removal.</b></li>\n"
"<ul><li>Contact the vendor of the removed add-on to provide you with a new\n"
"installation media</li><li>Or select the appropriate online extension or "
"module\n"
"in the registration step</li><li>Or to continue with product upgrade go to "
"the\n"
"software selection and mark the product (the -release package) for removal.\n"
"</li></ul></li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"<ul><li><b>ບາງຜະລິດຕະພັນຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ລຶບອອກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.</b></li>\n"
"<ul><li>ຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ຈຳໜ່າຍສ່ວນເສີມທີ່ຖືກລຶບອອກເພື່ອຂໍສື່ຕິດຕັ້ງ\n"
"ໃໝ່</li><li>ຫຼື ເລືອກສ່ວນເສີມ ຫຼື ໂມດູນອອນລາຍທີ່ເໝາະສົມ\n"
"ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນການລົງທະບຽນ</li><li>ຫຼື ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການອັບເກຣດຜະລິດຕະພັນຕໍ່ ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່\n"
"ການເລືອກຊອບແວ ແລະ ໝາຍຜະລິດຕະພັນ (ແພັກເກດ -release) ເພື່ອລຶບອອກ.\n"
"</li></ul></li></ul>"

#. TRANSLATORS: warning message
#: src/modules/Packages.rb:789
msgid ""
"The NTP configuration (chrony) has been modified, but the package is not "
"selected to be installed."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ NTP (chrony) ຖືກແກ້ໄຂແລ້ວ, ແຕ່ແພັກເກດຍັງບໍ່ຖືກເລືອກເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. Checking if all needed packages for remote installation
#. will be installed on the target system.
#. @return [String] empty string or error message if there are missing packages
#: src/modules/Packages.rb:831
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Cannot support %s remote access in the installed system due to missing "
"packages \n"
"%s. \n"
"It will be disabled."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ສາມາດຮອງຮັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງທາງໄກ %s ໃນລະບົບທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ ເນື່ອງຈາກຂາດແພັກເກດ \n"
"%s. \n"
"ມັນຈະຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

#: src/modules/Packages.rb:836
msgid ""
"But the AutoYaST installation will be still finished automatically without "
"any user interaction."
msgstr "ແຕ່ການຕິດຕັ້ງ AutoYaST ຈະຍັງຄົງສຳເລັດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ໂຕ້ຕອບ."

#. error in proposal, %1 is URL
#: src/modules/Packages.rb:1199
#, ycp-format
msgid "No repository found at '%1'."
msgstr "ບໍ່ພົບຄັງຊອບແວຢູ່ '%1'."

#. TRANSLATORS: beginning of the rich text with the release notes
#: src/modules/Packages.rb:1408
msgid ""
"<p><b>The release notes for the initial release are part of the "
"installation\n"
"media. If an Internet connection is available during configuration, you can\n"
"download updated release notes from the SUSE Linux Web server.</b></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ບັນທຶກການປ່ອຍ (release notes) ສຳລັບການປ່ອຍຄັ້ງທຳອິດແມ່ນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງສື່\n"
"ຕິດຕັ້ງ. ຫາກມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອິນເຕີເນັດໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ທ່ານສາມາດ\n"
"ດາວໂຫຼດບັນທຶກການປ່ອຍທີ່ອັບເດດແລ້ວຈາກເວັບເຊີເວີ SUSE Linux ໄດ້.</b></p>\n"

#. popup - information label
#: src/modules/Packages.rb:1434
msgid "Integrating booted media..."
msgstr "ກຳລັງຮວບຮວມສື່ທີ່ບູດ..."

#. close the popup in order to be able to ask about the license
#: src/modules/Packages.rb:1450
msgid "Failed to integrate the service pack repository."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດຮວບຮວມຄັງຊອບແວ service pack ໄດ້."

#. popup - information label
#: src/modules/Packages.rb:1483
msgid "Initializing repositories..."
msgstr "ກຳລັງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຄັງຊອບແວ..."

#. an error message
#: src/modules/Packages.rb:1776
#, ycp-format
msgid ""
"Error while initializing package descriptions.\n"
"Check the log file %1 for more details."
msgstr ""
"ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນລະຫວ່າງການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຄຳອະທິບາຍແພັກເກດ.\n"
"ກວດສອບໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກ %1 ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. bnc #436925
#: src/modules/Packages.rb:1996
msgid ""
"The software selection has been changed externally.\n"
"Software proposal will be called again."
msgstr ""
"ການເລືອກຊອບແວຖືກປ່ຽນແປງຈາກພາຍນອກ.\n"
"ຂໍ້ສະເໜີຊອບແວຈະຖືກເອີ້ນໃຊ້ຄືນໃໝ່."

#. popup label
#: src/modules/Packages.rb:2015
msgid "Evaluating package selection..."
msgstr "ກຳລັງປະເມີນການເລືອກແພັກເກດ..."

#. TRANSLATORS: error popup, use at most 70 characters per line
#. the %{fips_option} string is replaced by the FIPS boot option ("fips=1"),
#. the %{fips_pattern} is replaced by the FIPS pattern name ("fips").
#: src/modules/Packages.rb:2169
#, perl-brace-format
msgid ""
"The FIPS compliant mode has been enabled\n"
"but the '%{fips_pattern}' pattern is not available to install.\n"
"\n"
"The installation will very likely fail and the installed system\n"
"might not work properly.\n"
"\n"
"Either add an additional software repository providing\n"
"the '%{fips_pattern}' pattern or reboot the installation\n"
"without the '%{fips_option}' boot option."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດທີ່ຮອງຮັບ FIPS ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານແລ້ວ\n"
"ແຕ່ຮູບແບບ '%{fips_pattern}' ບໍ່ມີໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ.\n"
"\n"
"ການຕິດຕັ້ງມີແນວໂນ້ມທີ່ຈະລົ້ມເຫຼວ ແລະ ລະບົບທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ\n"
"ອາດຈະເຮັດວຽກບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ.\n"
"\n"
"ກະລຸນາເພີ່ມຄັງຊອບແວເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່ມີ\n"
"ຮູບແບບ '%{fips_pattern}' ຫຼື ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່\n"
"ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຕົວເລືອກການບູດ '%{fips_option}'."

#. %s is a list of pattern names
#: src/modules/Packages.rb:2430
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Failed to select default product patterns:\n"
"%s\n"
"Patterns have not been found.\n"
"\n"
"This can probably be fixed by adding\n"
"more installation repositories by going back to\n"
"the 'Registration' or 'Add On Product' screens."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ສາມາດເລືອກຮູບແບບຜະລິດຕະພັນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ:\n"
"%s\n"
"ບໍ່ພົບຮູບແບບ.\n"
"\n"
"ອາດຈະແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍການເພີ່ມ\n"
"ຄັງຊອບແວຕິດຕັ້ງເພີ່ມເຕີມ ໂດຍການຍ້ອນກັບໄປທີ່\n"
"ໜ້າຈໍ 'ການລົງທະບຽນ' ຫຼື 'ຜະລິດຕະພັນສ່ວນເສີມ'."

#. TRANSLATORS: %s is a package list
#: src/modules/Packages.rb:2561
#, c-format
msgid "These packages need to be selected to install: %s"
msgstr "ແພັກເກດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຖືກເລືອກເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ: %s"

#. TRANSLATORS: %s is a pattern list
#: src/modules/Packages.rb:2564
#, c-format
