#. popup question
#: src/modules/ProductLicense.rb:596
msgid "Really abort the add-on product installation?"
msgstr "ຕ້ອງການຍົກເລີກການຕິດຕັ້ງຜະລິດຕະພັນສ່ວນເສີມແທ້ຫຼືບໍ່?"

#. text changed due to bug #162499
#. TRANSLATORS: text asking whether to refuse a license (Yes-No popup)
#: src/modules/ProductLicense.rb:630
msgid ""
"Refusing the license agreement cancels the add-on\n"
"product installation. Really refuse the agreement?"
msgstr ""
"ການປະຕິເສດຂໍ້ຕົກລົງໃບອະນຸຍາດຈະຍົກເລີກການຕິດຕັ້ງ\n"
"ຜະລິດຕະພັນສ່ວນເສີມ. ຕ້ອງການປະຕິເສດຂໍ້ຕົກລົງແທ້ຫຼືບໍ່?"

#. timed ok/cancel popup
#: src/modules/ProductLicense.rb:644
msgid "The system is shutting down..."
msgstr "ລະບົບກຳລັງປິດເຄື່ອງ..."

#. help text
#: src/modules/ProductLicense.rb:718
msgid ""
"<p>Read the license agreement carefully and select\n"
"one of the available options. If you do not agree to the license agreement,\n"
"the configuration will be aborted.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ກະລຸນາອ່ານຂໍ້ຕົກລົງໃບອະນຸຍາດຢ່າງລະອຽດ ແລະ ເລືອກ\n"
"ໜຶ່ງໃນຕົວເລືອກທີ່ມີໃຫ້. ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ຍອມຮັບຂໍ້ຕົກລົງໃບອະນຸຍາດ,\n"
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈະຖືກຍົກເລີກ.</p>\n"

#. TRANSLATORS: %{license_url} is an URL where the displayed license can be found
#: src/modules/ProductLicense.rb:763
#, perl-brace-format
