#. help text - server dialog
#: src/modules/SourceDialogs.rb:1936
msgid ""
"<p><big><b>Server and Directory</b></big><br>\n"
"Use <b>Server Name</b> and <b>Path to Directory or ISO Image</b>\n"
"to specify the NFS server host name and path on the server.\n"
"To enable authentication, uncheck <b>Anonymous</b> and specify the\n"
"<b>User Name</b> and the <b>Password</b>.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"For the SMB/CIFS repository, specify <b>Share</b> name and <b>Path to "
"Directory\n"
"or ISO Image</b>. \n"
"If the location is a file holding an ISO image\n"
"of the media, set <b>ISO Image</b>.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><big><b>ເຊີເວີ ແລະ ໂຟນເດີ</b></big><br>\n"
"ໃຊ້ <b>ຊື່ເຊີເວີ</b> ແລະ <b>ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໂຟນເດີ ຫຼື ISO Image</b>\n"
"ເພື່ອລະບຸຊື່ໂຮສຂອງເຊີເວີ NFS ແລະ ເສັ້ນທາງໃນເຊີເວີ.\n"
"ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ, ໃຫ້ຍົກເລີກການໝາຍ <b>ບໍ່ລະບຸຕົວຕົນ</b> ແລະ ລະບຸ\n"
"<b>ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້</b> ແລະ <b>ລະຫັດຜ່ານ</b>.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"ສຳລັບຄັງຊອບແວ SMB/CIFS, ໃຫ້ລະບຸຊື່ <b>Share</b> ແລະ <b>ເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາໂຟນເດີ\n"
"ຫຼື ISO Image</b>. \n"
"ຫາກສະຖານທີ່ແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເກັບ ISO image\n"
"ຂອງສື່, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ <b>ISO Image</b>.</p>\n"

#. help text - server dialog, there is a "Port" widget
#: src/modules/SourceDialogs.rb:1949
msgid ""
"<p>It is possible to set the <b>Port</b> number for a HTTP/HTTPS "
"repository.\n"
"Leave it empty to use the default port.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ມັນເປັນໄປໄດ້ທີ່ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າໝາຍເລກ <b>ພອດ</b> ສຳລັບຄັງເກັບ HTTP/HTTPS.\n"
"ປ່ອຍໃຫ້ມັນວ່າງໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ພອດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ.</p>\n"

#. Returns whether Community Repositories are defined in the control file.
#.
#. @return [Boolean] whether defined
#: src/modules/SourceDialogs.rb:1984
msgid "I would li&ke to install an additional Add On Product"
msgstr "ຂ້ອຍຕ້ອງ&ການຕິດຕັ້ງຜະລິດຕະພັນສ່ວນເສີມເພີ່ມເຕີມ"

#: src/modules/SourceDialogs.rb:2002
msgid "Net&work Configuration..."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອ&ຂ່າຍ..."

#. help text
#: src/modules/SourceDialogs.rb:2122
msgid ""
"<p><big><b>Media Type</b></big><br>\n"
"The software repository can be located on CD, on a network server,\n"
"or on the hard disk.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><big><b>ປະເພດຂອງສື່</b></big><br>\n"
"ຄັງຊອບແວສາມາດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນ CD, ໃນເຊີເວີເຄືອຂ່າຍ,\n"
"ຫຼື ໃນຮາດດິດ.</p>"

#. help, continued
#: src/modules/SourceDialogs.rb:2131
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"To add  <b>CD</b> or <b>DVD</b>,\n"
"have the product CD set or the DVD available.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"ເພື່ອເພີ່ມ <b>CD</b> ຫຼື <b>DVD</b>,\n"
"ໃຫ້ກຽມຊຸດ CD ຜະລິດຕະພັນ ຫຼື DVD ໃຫ້ພ້ອມ.</p>"

#. help, continued
#: src/modules/SourceDialogs.rb:2141
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"The product CDs can be copied to the hard disk.\n"
"Enter the path to the first CD, for example, /data1/<b>CD1</b>.\n"
"Only the base path is required if all CDs are copied\n"
"into the same directory.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"ແຜ່ນຊີດີຜະລິດຕະພັນສາມາດສຳເນົາລົງໃນຮາດດິດໄດ້.\n"
"ປ້ອນເສັ້ນທາງໄປຫາຊີດີແຜ່ນທຳອິດ, ຕົວຢ່າງ, /data1/<b>CD1</b>.\n"
"ຕ້ອງການພຽງແຕ່ເສັ້ນທາງຫຼັກເທົ່ານັ້ນ ຖ້າຫາກແຜ່ນຊີດີທັງໝົດຖືກສຳເນົາ\n"
"ລົງໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີດຽວກັນ.</p>\n"

#. help, continued
#: src/modules/SourceDialogs.rb:2153
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"Network installation requires a working network connection.\n"
"Specify the directory in which the packages from\n"
"the first CD are located, such as /data1/CD1.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"ການຕິດຕັ້ງຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍຕ້ອງການການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ໃຊ້ການໄດ້.\n"
"ລະບຸໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ແພັກເກດຕ່າງໆຈາກ\n"
"ແຜ່ນຊີດີທຳອິດເກັບໄວ້ຢູ່, ເຊັ່ນວ່າ /data1/CD1.</p>\n"

#. error popup
#: src/modules/SourceDialogs.rb:2170
msgid "Select the media type"
msgstr "ເລືອກປະເພດຂອງສື່"

#: src/modules/SourceDialogs.rb:2177
msgid "Insert the add-on product CD"
msgstr "ກະລຸນາໃສ່ CD ຜະລິດຕະພັນສ່ວນເສີມ"

#: src/modules/SourceDialogs.rb:2179
msgid "Insert the add-on product DVD"
msgstr "ກະລຸນາໃສ່ DVD ຜະລິດຕະພັນສ່ວນເສີມ"

#. ask for a medium
#: src/modules/SourceDialogs.rb:2198
msgid "No USB disk was detected."
msgstr "ກວດບໍ່ພົບ USB disk ໃດໆ."

#. use three slashes as third slash means path
#: src/modules/SourceDialogs.rb:2414
msgid ""
"<p><b>Download Files</b><br>\n"
"Each repository has description files which describe the content of the\n"
"repository. Check <b>Download repository description files</b> to download "
"the\n"
"files when closing this YaST module. If the option is unchecked, YaST will\n"
"automatically download the files when it needs them later. </p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ດາວໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌</b><br>\n"
"ຄັງຊອບແວແຕ່ລະອັນມີໄຟລ໌ຄຳອະທິບາຍເຊິ່ງບອກເຖິງເນື້ອໃນຂອງ\n"
"ຄັງຊອບແວ. ໝາຍເລືອກ <b>ດາວໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ຄຳອະທິບາຍຄັງຊອບແວ</b> ເພື່ອດາວໂຫຼດ\n"
"ໄຟລ໌ຕ່າງໆເມື່ອປິດໂມດູນ YaST ນີ້. ຫາກບໍ່ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້, YaST ຈະ\n"
"ດາວໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອມີຄວາມຈຳເປັນໃນພາຍຫຼັງ. </p>\n"

